I analyzed the scalability considerations, indexing strategy, and deployment options. For the current PoC dataset, Local Neo4j is sufficient. 
For production-scale deployments (100K+ nodes and beyond), indexes on key identifiers, query optimization, subgraph retrieval patterns, 
and AuraDB/clustered deployments would be recommended

